    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'The Quarry - free play, infinite energy, no goals. Mess around.

    The
    Gauntlet - a five-beat course; play BOTH variants back to back.

    Variant
    A: aiming midair spends a separate 2s budget (refills on crash).

    Variant
    B: aiming midair drains your energy tank instead.'
